 he spirit of Día de los Muertos with heartfelt remembrances and joyful fe
 stivities. Enjoy cultural dances and music\, explore the brightly adorned 
 ofrendas. Try traditional foods. Mariachi Agave and Ballet Folklorico de C
 olores perform. Children can decorate sugar skulls and there will be face 
 painting.\n\nEvent website: https://www.flagstaffarizona.org/events/festiv
 als/celebraciones-de-la-gente/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visit
 arizona.com/events/23rd-annual-celebraciones-de-la-gente
